      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "use lock in mem-initializer.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "It has exactly the right sematnics - using an unnamed temporary (lifetime ends at end of full expression and value of , is last item).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "But issue is that for constexpr functions - the lock crap violates the constexpr rules (at least msvc 2k17).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Not super importnat cuz doesnt affect correctness, but nice to fix so we get better debug race checking.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
         "type" : "doc",
         "version" : 1
      },
